    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Through intense study and meditation, you awaken a reservoir of primal arcane power within yourself.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Arcane spellcaster level 1st, Int 13 or Cha 13 (depending on your key spellcasting modifier).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain an arcane pool of 2 points and can obtain arcane focus and take arcana feats.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc59\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
